{
  "id": "ex07-offside-myths",
  "series": "Explainer",
  "variant": "FORMAT: myth v fact cards · no people needed",
  "title": "Five offside myths, busted",
  "layout": "explainer",
  "music": "04-dribble.mp3",
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voiceId": "WAppqUXeqDqXjNTaQxG9"
  },
  "sources": [
    "https://www.theifab.com/laws/latest/offside/"
  ],
  "images": {},
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Five things people get wrong about offside.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "statement",
        "bg": "red",
        "text": "OFFSIDE|MYTHS"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Number one: level is offside.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "myth",
        "bg": "red",
        "verdict": "myth",
        "label": "#1",
        "claim": "LEVEL|IS OFFSIDE"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Wrong. If you're level with the second-last defender, you're onside.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "myth",
        "bg": "green",
        "verdict": "fact",
        "label": "THE LAW",
        "claim": "LEVEL|IS ONSIDE"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Number two: you can be offside from a throw-in.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "myth",
        "bg": "red",
        "verdict": "myth",
        "label": "#2",
        "claim": "OFFSIDE FROM|A THROW-IN"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "You can't. Or from a goal kick, or a corner.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "statement",
        "bg": "teal",
        "text": "THROW-IN|GOAL KICK|CORNER",
        "hi": 1,
        "size": 120
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Number three: you can't be offside in your own half.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "myth",
        "bg": "green",
        "verdict": "fact",
        "label": "#3",
        "claim": "NOT OFFSIDE IN|YOUR OWN HALF"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "That one's true.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "statement",
        "bg": "green",
        "text": "TRUE"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Number four: being in an offside position is an offence.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "myth",
        "bg": "red",
        "verdict": "myth",
        "label": "#4",
        "claim": "OFFSIDE POSITION|= OFFENCE"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Only if you get involved. Stand still and stay out of it, and nothing happens.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "press",
        "bg": "green",
        "won": "NOT INVOLVED = NO OFFENCE"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And number five: your arms don't count.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "myth",
        "bg": "green",
        "verdict": "fact",
        "label": "#5",
        "claim": "ARMS|DON'T COUNT"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "True. Only the parts you can legally score with.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "statement",
        "bg": "purple",
        "text": "HEAD · BODY · FEET",
        "size": 110
      }
    }
  ]
}